# 3. Multi-Agent Orchestration
## Microsoft Agent Framework — Workflow Orchestrations
https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/agent-framework/workflows/orchestrations/
Agent Framework provides orchestration patterns including:
- **Sequential** — agents execute one after another.
- **Concurrent** — agents execute in parallel.
- **Handoff** — agents transfer control to each other.
- **Group Chat** — agents collaborate in a shared conversation.
- **Magentic** — a manager agent dynamically coordinates specialized agents.
For the Scrum Pod idea, **Group Chat** and **Magentic** are especially relevant.
## Agents in Workflows
https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/agent-framework/workflows/agents-in-workflows/
Use this to understand how agents can be integrated into workflow steps.
