# 4. Foundry Visual Workflows
## Build a Workflow in Microsoft Foundry
https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/agents/concepts/workflow
Foundry's visual workflow builder can orchestrate multiple agents.
It includes patterns such as:
- Sequential
- Group Chat
- Human-in-the-loop
## Important 2026 Note
Microsoft currently states that **Foundry Workflows are being retired on December 1, 2026**.
For new development, Microsoft recommends **Microsoft Agent Framework**.
Therefore:
> Use Foundry for the agents/platform, and use Microsoft Agent Framework as the main orchestration layer for a new Scrum Pod.
