18. Important Design Rule

Do not make every agent autonomous all the time.

Use clear responsibility boundaries.

For example:

Product Manager
     |
     | Requirements
     v
Scrum Master
     |
     | Tasks
     v
Developer
     |
     | Implementation
     v
QA
     |
     | Test Result
     v
Scrum Master

This reduces:

* Token usage
* Conflicting decisions
* Infinite loops
* Duplicate work
* Unnecessary model calls

