21. Bottom Line

The thing to build is not a Microsoft feature literally called “Pod.”

The correct Microsoft stack for this idea is:

Microsoft Foundry Agent Service + Microsoft Agent Framework + Multi-Agent Orchestration

The most relevant orchestration patterns are:

Group Chat and Magentic

For a new project in 2026:

Use Microsoft Agent Framework as the primary orchestration layer and Microsoft Foundry as the managed agent/model platform.

Start with:

